   "body_html": "<!--[if BLOCK]><![endif]-->            <p>This could be just a <em>ME</em> issue but it bugs out if I try to fire it. I didn\u2019t try it in single fire but I tried twice in auto. Doesn\u2019t fire the first round but it registers as fired in the ammo count, and the charging handle gets stuck in a auto firing loop. Literally the only thing I can do is walk, sprint, crouch and go prone until I extract. All is fine and dandy at the start of the next raid.</p>\n\n        <!--[if ENDBLOCK]><![endif]-->",
